{% endif %}

{% if exists("stewardVisit") %}
A steward came out this week (canon): {{ stewardVisit.stewardName }}, who keeps {% if stewardVisit.hold != "" %}{{ stewardVisit.hold }}{% else %}the hold{% endif %}'s books for {{ playerName }}, travelled out and spent a day or two here looking the work over in person. Ordinary business, not a summons and not a collection — but somebody was watching this week, and how that sat with them (seen at last, or checked up on) is worth a beat.
{% endif %}
{% if exists("stewardTrip") %}
They went out on the road this week (canon): as the hold's steward they walked out to {{ stewardTrip.retainerName }}{% if existsIn(stewardTrip, "retainerJob") and stewardTrip.retainerJob != "" %}, the {{ stewardTrip.retainerJob }}{% endif %}{% if existsIn(stewardTrip, "retainerPlace") and stewardTrip.retainerPlace != "" %}, at {{ stewardTrip.retainerPlace }}{% endif %}, and spent a day or two there before coming back to the books. The journey and what they found are fair subject for this week's entry.
{% endif %}
{% if length(default(recentLifeEvents, [])) > 0 %}
Their life outside the work lately, oldest first (canon: the entry may nod to these or carry their mood, but must never contradict them):
{% for e in recentLifeEvents %}
- {{ e }}
{% endfor %}
(If one of these left a mark — a night in jail, a fight, a loss, a romance — let its shadow fall on this week's entry rather than pretending it never happened. But the entry is still about the week of work; the life events are its weather, not its subject.)
{% endif %}
{% if length(default(prisoners, [])) > 0 %}
Held in a cell right now (canon: none of them walked free this week):
{% for p in prisoners %}
- {{ p.name }}, held in {% if p.jail != "" %}{{ p.jail }}{% if p.hold != "" %} ({{ p.hold }}){% endif %}{% elif p.hold != "" %}the {{ p.hold }} jail{% else %}a hold's jail{% endif %}{% if p.daysHeld > 0 %}, {{ p.daysHeld }} {% if p.daysHeld == 1 %}day{% else %}days{% endif %} so far{% endif %}{% if p.weeksLeft > 0 %}, about {{ p.weeksLeft }} {% if p.weeksLeft == 1 %}week{% else %}weeks{% endif %} still to serve{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
If the week touches any of them (a crewmate, a customer, a supplier, someone they deal with), the entry must reflect the cell: the gap they left at the work, a visit to the jail, word passed through a guard, their affairs in someone else's hands. Never write them working, trading, drinking or walking about.
{% endif %}
